 | GET | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | |
 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
+| POST | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}/move` | `{"toProjectId"}` → 200 with the moved task |
+
+Moving keeps the task's ID, title, status and assignee. It requires the
+manager role in the source project and the contributor or manager role in the
+destination (an unreadable destination is 404, an archived one 409). The
+assignee must be a contributor or manager of the destination (else 400); a
+destination contributor can only move in tasks assigned to themselves or to
+nobody (else 403). Moving into the same project is 400.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
